{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>韓國天團BIGBANG今日起於啟德主場館舉行四場BIGBANG 2026-2027 WORLD TOUR &lt; XX : COSMOS &gt; IN HONG KONG演唱會。場內官方周邊商品售賣處設於啟德體育園（體育園）東營，今早11時開始安檢前已有數百名粉絲在園區排隊等候購買官方紀念品，現場人流管理及分流安排理想，樂迷均有序排隊選購心儀商品，整體秩序良好，流程暢順。</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1197929970337320960245783.jpeg/2kWAZPq0c3mzOJ36OIH2CJ8zsLSK5RmXc4wQwHOMEMA\"/><p>為便利粉絲選購心儀紀念品，體育園與主辦單位溝通協調後，特別優化現場安排。周邊商品售賣處工作人員Judy表示︰「我們將商品展示區、付款區及取貨區分隔，並將深受樂迷歡迎的手燈獨立分流出另一條隊伍處理，與購買所有周邊商品的觀眾分開，以提升效率及疏導人流。」</p><p>此外，場內亦設有餐飲站，提供飲品及小食，方便排隊人士補充水分及休息。整體而言，粉絲均遵守現場安排，秩序良好。</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1197930017229639680510238.jpeg/cIObVk5X2E02bLIY74KCK45EldWdpDrGScoPYEnKD2A\"/><p>有粉絲表示，對現場安排感到滿意。陳小姐及孔小姐今早約6時已到場排隊，每人消費約2,000港元。她們認為現場秩序不俗，亦感覺主辦單位吸收了台灣場的經驗，令購物安排更為順暢。兩人完成購物後，計劃先到附近用膳及逛街，稍後再返回啟德主場館欣賞演出。</p><p>另一組樂迷張小姐則於今早約9時到場，每人消費約2,000至3,000港元。她們表示，整個購物過程約需3小時，與原先預期相若，對現場秩序及安排感到滿意。雖然排隊期間天氣較為炎熱，但整體購物體驗符合預期，完成選購後亦打算在附近逛逛。</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1197930063429898240014376.jpeg/sjLq-Tbkr8McEXF5T_nYiM34b8TpA6EcDw37Rw8N-0c\"/><p>啟德育園經理（園區）陳樂熙今晨一早到場視察環境及運作情況。他表示，園區及主辦方均有安排顧客服務員在場，協助樂迷了解商品資訊及選購心儀商品。他感謝樂迷配合現場安排，有序排隊及選購，令整體流程順暢。</p><p>體育園呼籲有意購買官方紀念品的人士預留充足時間，提早進場並預先選定心儀商品，以便更順利完成購物流程；同時，請因應天氣情況做好防曬或防雨措施，並可隨身攜帶縮骨遮等雨具。</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1197930169634394112071296.jpeg/nnDaHCiyS35Xk9NL_chYzBjwqTaoTdQKqWTkeqlk5Ho\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1197930167667134464518274.jpeg/rnV9bxG-p-pwxFrEvQWCQzK0KGAV1Jd49W0j7PVtI-w\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1197930165276250112943526.jpeg/px5sXzjOrb85VekFU7lK6cnNhtE6bCNnNhevyjYXr8o\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1197930163074109440493581.jpeg/OAlNHw6Ayvk7PlnAHs_ap4bEHtETVzaHd4j0y3eI9Ms\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1197930160716779520125089.jpeg/6UhS5uEV-r_AO4eziNpYRIdtEAUNwGVY_KVr__yla_8\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1197930170775244800729840.jpeg/3YN3oqORYlyhVz6-greiHEsGT8DNehhDzq0rhs6tK4Y\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1197930168585687040530476.jpeg/DQtL9VUGJpIkg8cK_66vwPrPcbEISUesqfvDpan7w6U\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1197930166345797632508143.jpeg/VyqlQ9g_omXymQPNQ0AGmzftD2-gUWQAiSqU5YkqlOU\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1197930164156239872203168.jpeg/EcRs6LXqV5iaAsnYL8ahrJZsQqhosVu5Uo5UwlKOVMI\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1197930161811492864469705.jpeg/AD4MEOqFX1bpAzDBifhu-7rH9d0Eut11o6M_ZaOjP2U\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1197930171140149248879654.jpeg/JCe_9Wo8T6CwBClyPyXWUmlqtm1qbgQssUDDz7FAw88\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1197930168988340224816073.jpeg/VaL4lGN_iTP8CfwcKCPMR-fGmxh5OFxZj0KnvI9Cp7w\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1197930166786199552938051.jpeg/65TwBGTtgn_LScYJ4Uz2YaDQHRbj_KHXujRn8bo0Z_E\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1197930164483395584467391.jpeg/cJYhczcR7T-Dd5I4SLTYanc-3FcmvEdlp9OvuqfTr7o\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261113/1197930162230923264750639.jpeg/QFt3FbGeRtuCSu0WaefyzELZ19Svd7CsRzecWUc3nFk\"/></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T07:28:39.948210+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":782,"images":18,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T07:11:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T07:22:03.019699+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T07:22:03.019699+00:00","content_hash":"4fdf34c00827dd6dac1782f639b06c5c61de47f096d78826e919c6721da198d5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}